OL,3,GNEWSAHeart attack patient, 83, had to
OL,4,Adrive four hours for hospital
OL,5,Aappointment
OL,6,
OL,7,FAn 83-year-old recovering cancer
OL,8,Fpatient who has suffered two heart
OL,9,Fattacks was forced to drive himself on
OL,10,Fa four-hour round trip for medical
OL,11,Ftests.
OL,13,FCharles Swift was referred to Withybush
OL,14,FHospital in Haverfordwest,
OL,15,FPembrokeshire, for tests on his heart
OL,16,Fin August - he lives in Borth,
OL,17,FCeredigion - which is 70 miles away.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,440,430,260,140,0,100
