OL,3,GNEWSAHeart attack patient, 83, had to
OL,4,Adrive four hours for hospital
OL,5,Aappointment
OL,6,
OL,7,FHe made inquiries about getting
OL,8,Fnon-emergency transport but was refused
OL,9,Fby a call handler from the Welsh
OL,10,FAmbulance Services Trust (WAST) when he
OL,11,Ftold them he owned a car.
OL,13,F"I can't understand why pensioners have
OL,14,Fto run about in their own car," he
OL,15,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
